  m_text: '<b>Administration Time</b>

    Self-paced

    <b>Directions</b>

    Say,
    <i>Complete what I say.</i> For example, <i>ice is . . . (cold).</i> Present
    the test items.

    <b>Scoring</b>

    Score <i>2 points</i> if the target
    response or a reasonable alternative response is given (e.g., Sugar is . . .
    fattening). Score <i>1 point</i> for a phonemic paraphasia or off-target alternative
    responses (e.g., Grass is . . . brown). Score <i>0 points</i> for an unreasonable
    response (e.g., Grass is . . . cold).'
